    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2659b3175f48072e2b2f509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要稍微…更加努力了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "157d37a26c77acfe3621a8e1111acc19345643543547931906fcc115be67d156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9478b1773a6eb61ec56aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，看到了吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a60c42f4327563aef7871c431d4ce8deb55b11a97ed122c5696e39574c3447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47fea163183efa61a4490a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，必须更加努力才行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "123bf9ba8e192da20dc3ba1ddd1b5640336083a4ae2627460a61f2e07c2495d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7628a9a98570e23e796e8842",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样下去，可不行啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7b1bb01b9632a4592dd7c39ca085360392184f80c687cda48cfed6f69a10e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54209219c9bdfab387cda93e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊啊…米浴做到了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "260febee5a85715dd6303ddb73bf2142e60410f815237b3dd8742d1d50172cbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18bd83065b90feac4a6a619b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有所改变了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ea2e7324f872ebdd697c22fb678cc00430833a49869c0f9c588736333a12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1349bf945236961685b9cc7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获胜的奖励、印在脖子上！\r\n什么的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b8919e29eb04265eec9177603009e0d7fcb5016af3190918b3c6e5d9a0e436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9f8b7896527ce8a90b528cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有所改变了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ea2e7324f872ebdd697c22fb678cc00430833a49869c0f9c588736333a12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48092f9422801791a206ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，看到了吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb23eefcaa1571e69b600a550786fadbd66cffa1bcca581b89b98a5dc2bde5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83aee7d977f2227755bb096d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴在决胜中的愿望……\r\n全都实现了哦…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c7940811e037c6c089a076fb979dd19ff9436c56d98f9e7850ec694b2d2f88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1dee94486c2f38973fab50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……也有所改变了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceee1722ad27ac3637bb9628a6f906befc7155412688b06a66619ecdff76e7ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0bff370d488233f38defc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b805ba98ac4d2ee1bffc35cdabff8b5674a60835ba99277b3de4e6a2d13872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c228f5141212d852cf031f9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也…能绽放…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd3c65429a3a28202bc09d04d812b65177754f0a3f4d9ec56aeefe8fd8d3cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb5948131a9725ae0f52fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……波旁同学，看起来很辛苦。\r\n可是，就算米浴去帮忙也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4902840eef781e1a305edb8d12b99b0a67df97543049a52bb38ff96a0349e6df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74346293fba6ffdf73249c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为缪斯……\r\n米浴也能为大家带来笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08688307f2a5dc82ecd6eae6343425a71e7ed59d50bb0d59498fd7c49c9b8ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e6667016bf13d4a69b03af4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然谜题很难……\r\n但和大家在一起的话\r\n一定没问题的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff37753430c1748ff9665658a6cc82e5d26e21f9a85eb259cf6e2035a8c92c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1c9f7b84aa284ad5b2998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……不，就算是米浴也……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98144455bf545f346bc039486659584b08971d7d51326b69052a9028990ca6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252617b23fc40cf356ccc1d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赫、赫、赫——\r\n要吸你的血了哦~……！\r\n欸嘿嘿，这样还是有点太恐怖了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5972edf6382a1ba999a70ebd01ce2864c4b9a5d0a085196742e2f4428eda221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4acc0a5a4ddb27684dcbc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发誓…和最喜欢的人一起…幸福的蓝蔷薇。\n…米浴…也要绽放给你看…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a825cd4cd47d94b06339ce9769f859761d00582628c90c0b87769f9e6854a36d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29546905bd79cd4ed24bb533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……做到了……\r\n成为了让大家露出笑容的缪斯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f25f79001389275944a66a7feea2835e49b9070fa07ee086145eb90d01734937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c88aa50b98ae043e86b975c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是有活动任务呢。\r\n一起加油吧，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6bd0ddecd9b4a4bdf59c581da484ad14886673bc3372e20e7519ecf417ee1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81a5f32c1bf784ab624e02d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "报酬，都收到了吗……？\r\n可以的话……要和米浴一起确认一下\r\n有没有忘记的东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "886fb4b81c9b1eb76bf6399ce9f2da0f70c5a11db9ae5145c16d1b1540c13830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad674e3f0b7c767f82e41d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了。\r\n那个，那个……万圣节快乐……！\r\n欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56075494d784ad454111060594e07a80fe236b49b530e884933bf6af5507d1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d76c4354be58e8e42794ea3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝙蝠先生…一起上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "253483bb144a8757311798001642a9fea33adddced3221b1a3e52ebfc1b49dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208494a47f6a77054100c594",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好美的月亮……呀！？\r\n那个、那个……嘎哦！……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c170b582ad4b4d8ebc28e858e4855026c84e759593ff49be32185010e7fdc3e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe61e59d0da0083fd4be44e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应援？……欸嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d52685385230a78b2ad0f722660bdc8e011cb8eb039d679f24b68ea846c2f900",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12797e7cb03060e8b0f2d00f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——！要变得幸福、呼诶！？\r\n啊……呵呵♪……嗯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec6e7ca42e34c37b790c4ee41f1b57b16973c5ea2d37abd52a4cb2473a5cff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2db62d5d6cd5a751056b6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能来听听，米浴唱歌吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3045917b8cab599c9e41eb29b4de2a92e434b68784008c0938eed0b5875c0e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b40d2743862f226a5c1654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，能高兴就好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4187f578181acb49b0d7a2f2b903e8dd17b572c89644835c6a31eda9517a85d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb98eba895fe6d83ebfae808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴的表现…看好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "894aa9c4f770dbcf9e1130010b016230acac322b5f69cd52b17714cbfff0bf06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6d6b67bde07477cd8ef7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起那个时候，\n米浴有所成长了吗？\n…如果有的话，我很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f673026ec38052995ef5be7b5e105a5ac4dcdcf35a359cdea1a08d186597ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6697a4c68660f4b96d9d46c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，合适吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbfcc1619b3cb23a738bff1068ffaf14855ec8aae28f3043e582c3fd89602af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b80d6b7d64b4f250eeacb7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇啊…轻飘飘的～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820631a615584e401767facdc772aaeab9b17276ca91b0e6941269651145eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377eecf5d839766a56968380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像蔷薇花一样…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b17b229e6e3a2657610ea01851b3083623b54ecd44756ad8eeef16c01357ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c3ad88771c1db7c8b87742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来到这里真是太好了…\n因为遇见了重要的人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e5d807293718437861029f55d8875fc08d4afb172c4f0d7325e10193bd256d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d859c68ab70cf0f250467b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被这样盯着看的话…好害羞啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20857c6de226ab55db50a65520f727bf5e4d99ddbc3251e8fc0dae498163962f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921089d4c665927ad3cf25e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也一定…很耀眼吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6d91df76994e33aec5441733f76fcb35ea2531d266be092e9f5446e6fe0784",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f194423a5d9f85a73bc9f1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好了，吸血鬼米浴……来了哦。\r\n……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd53ec212e1784fbe61064262a5886bceebe2bf245b15d28d7e140ca8c51733b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2866f162ca5df7c6c4d367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼诶……刚才的难道是……\r\n恶作剧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d07a3ba13f2871ee54310094edbba55d27f1406ece4dd7fb314e595416efc11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b562c1c62e7cfb5741af785",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要加油了，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20758fc051f8e40c3383b20bc1cfb64a39f5336afffa38143f6d4b9c9a0de22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997b2777e10e0fb8719eca61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是米浴，也能绽放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75209791e9cdb4f75f9924d7b80ada956cbcdb10900881f70a072de57063f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d771150ae76d113355368744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑衣服开心归开心，可是很困难……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7a9bc67cc2b796350d4a25b0fb6a1385cd1758c56cb6a1d2c58394ff47ffcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4356e795530e823567fa2416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴果然还是喜欢\r\n可爱的衣服吧……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "807fb055147d141db8d11b857d36de429ec6551b0364f17f3549f20b54519d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7876246c01710f0926cd0feb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，成为幸福的\r\n料理人了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf9f7db0e317ef52cb740c7a6cfa33a22cc736c55970fb397e6591d26e3837e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ac393bb75004707f3c7218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "徽章是米浴亲手做的……\r\n是米浴的，自信之作哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceebd3be31d99686beb5705952520d7560b406f6ad91351de79d3aa6c536c551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943d81db8ec0d68bceb6fdeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，合适吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbfcc1619b3cb23a738bff1068ffaf14855ec8aae28f3043e582c3fd89602af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61944a8bb0cd27cc37d44543",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇啊…轻飘飘的～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820631a615584e401767facdc772aaeab9b17276ca91b0e6941269651145eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50b547c78533145f8bab330d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像蔷薇花一样…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b17b229e6e3a2657610ea01851b3083623b54ecd44756ad8eeef16c01357ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d4b192be4920ace49b6e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来到这里真是太好了…\n因为遇见了重要的人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e5d807293718437861029f55d8875fc08d4afb172c4f0d7325e10193bd256d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c382ce939668ceb59bf99fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被这样盯着看的话…好害羞啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20857c6de226ab55db50a65520f727bf5e4d99ddbc3251e8fc0dae498163962f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97f6551e83438b141e317d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也一定…很耀眼吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6d91df76994e33aec5441733f76fcb35ea2531d266be092e9f5446e6fe0784",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95b51fa9ba5a7f7c4e9a86b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好了，吸血鬼米浴……来了哦。\r\n……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd53ec212e1784fbe61064262a5886bceebe2bf245b15d28d7e140ca8c51733b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6e1c25547c7dc61a9a129d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼诶……刚才的难道是……恶作剧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "498912a0fdd7eef5abc6442f61d017b4a9b3f1a6fcc09119c80947556441df37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfcde736f207cc80ffd3a09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要加油了，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20758fc051f8e40c3383b20bc1cfb64a39f5336afffa38143f6d4b9c9a0de22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb63ce32051101b44311ab0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是米浴，也能绽放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75209791e9cdb4f75f9924d7b80ada956cbcdb10900881f70a072de57063f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f1feb4f1476d32a0ad12ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，成为幸福的料理人了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2846726d50bea7dc5be575811aa04965fd277296065372d2c819b06a1f64ec5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b634779a1e0e6569c5def0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "徽章是米浴亲手做的……\r\n是米浴的，自信之作哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceebd3be31d99686beb5705952520d7560b406f6ad91351de79d3aa6c536c551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fcd6beabe8d6433ca152c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛、辛苦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57f6be6bf18e026343d4a3019a3c2877ece9ca74c5ee84af48e1fdd8259feab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617e26516b0a97dda6a8cf84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请、请多多指教……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f3d0f9d88578bc0cc192618ffedfbc819213a304286251cd20ab530f8bc53cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184dbb5d01eaa348ce906de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米、米浴，\r\n还能……继续加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcfeddbbad93a6a838ee8fe900ba94f151380a5e6845f1227958bf0bd182220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b90b6cca724898006be1023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥…哥哥！\n那个…早，早上好！\n…太好了，终于好好地说出来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e10d2e7b5a798e17d87c9793ae1488c0357f351b1a840d960f198444336eb45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b557a56d3bfb5c1649e0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上去训练时遇到了\n麦昆同学…跑得非常漂亮，\n优雅…让人心跳加速…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a938286c5e75572d1dfc7b3bb530f151842a0751f76da24273e71ac1c661cbc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:232ebb33a1ea6595ac0f1162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才，怒涛同学的便当\n被鸟抢走了…看起来很好吃\n什么的…如果米浴不说的话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "009baee63114a56e7797d84bd1cfb4a1c1036d489551054dbd60b22a32183c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de66def4c3776c42588f40b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午也请多关照！\n诶嘿嘿，很期待和哥哥\n一起的训练呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce254dafe6577fc134a8fd1926723190349bc4d98e4f8798c89111f39048209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:def39f852566337d5171a7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，哥哥。\n…让你工作到这么晚，对不起。\n米浴也要更加努力了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f28fc80cfb822bba4d86a0696fda440b23f1e608cec7eb96f0f07f3cf8334b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478b36b4f79eb5ec83dccc3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不困，还不困…\n米浴还不困哦…呼啊啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1629b0eb1450619e9c17bced50bb135d01fa74bd5719b622ed96812d083f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae165a0b5768d9c86a8075f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在外面跑的时候，在路边的角落里\n发现了朵小花。\n…已经是春天了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b38b4ebead8c6e7457db5de984d59c144da2da5b7e1b7f10d78605db13a2ab57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2faa72d870b5bd9b3c533a70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好热呢，哥哥…\n哈呼…就像粥一样，\n要融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "894f668c0e0615a0df5cb5a3a5800c8abea7514eb050f689c1f7b56e1608a352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9f2f1218c5944d91ad0ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，因为有漂亮的落叶\n所以捡回来了。妈妈收到信后\n会高兴吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0034adfffe367cefac12815cbeae602e8dcee100c5fa8b045cb54e7c28d1cf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8fdb4068a4cf281d8236454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，哥哥的脸蛋\n像苹果一样。呵呵，\n米浴的脸蛋…怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b43f9dedaa39f740d19bf1ebfca9a20c80948e2d7195cef170eeec7ce8f7385",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:882ded50e72fc21fbba05ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，有点困了吗…？\n点心，要吃吗？吃了甜食\n也许会精神点…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c726fe66ddedc6f43cdd1281db8eb061c1a2f3a2942e27cd5036a8484b8a21e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02de1b2bb6487973284a45ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈呜……呵呵。我熬夜了。\r\n因为一直在想着要是\r\n变成蝙蝠先生的话要去哪里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83dfc8a799f799a17650ec61cc23f104fa42ddf09e564f0c3abc8b2a9d509dc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c37a9015b692234b9b69b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是真的变成了吸血鬼的话……\r\n想忍着只喝番茄汁呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "90472ee291ab83055e747b8432ecdfefa60c5872e08ab9e6259ec5f7ff155a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf320f3fe9fcd2450f22901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼白天是要睡觉的吧……\r\n哥哥，有觉得累了吗？\r\n要一起睡午觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e39feb00a15a2e10c1a7318710d8a1b7d4f71f521ad6056a3fe24e9c27a57cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d90aab742f62a30ec3df41e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼米浴晚上也很有精神哦！\r\n哥哥，有什么我可以\r\n帮忙的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "463c1ff851325827a1439ec19264afb8b4a131b565b58a7f1cbc192ec3e48dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef0a06bf71f87c2c351ecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上……要、要是遇到\r\n鬼先生的话怎么办……\r\n这身打扮……能好好相处吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37da402a0b9a80610fa5d731a369e31a5cca2ecab626eaee76a15f0c1f4b3fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dff483fe14da763a320e201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说也有吸花蜜的蝙蝠。\r\n呵呵，好可爱……\r\n真想见一见啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea522ca57f69a06cb5618905701d3fcdf4fb9da07d19a72c6a59f82c66c57e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b0efbc4bed21f67a7c8f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天能听到很多\r\n鬼先生的故事呢……啊呜……\r\n万圣节之外也有好多鬼怪……",
      "source_fingerprint": "893edc0469fc66656618b9df8273ad29c165cdb5ff976c9d9055a0a57409a402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a69b3faf089158714ccc102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南瓜派、栗子蛋挞梨蛋糕\r\n还有红薯曲奇！\r\n哥哥喜欢哪个呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f282ea7ee7da4d4bc0d611cca00167ad5e15aff814a305afd36ca081cfe483c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af3a84bdf9769cd022089cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "住在大城堡的吸血鬼，到了冬天\r\n感觉会很冷呢……如果是米浴\r\n的话，大概会离不开暖炉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c24e7e3dca15f5f76cf7928820d1f99707b1c3a7342331294fea41d8f684da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90019"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
